[
  {
    "text": "窗口抖了一下。……是她。",
    "clip": "v_b683f44de7d612bd",
    "start": 0,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……吵架了。为了什么来着。",
    "clip": "v_44269c09f2e0434b",
    "start": 5.12,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "mood_target": "sad"
  },
  {
    "text": "和好了。……这比调参难。",
    "clip": "v_0a8536bf43d1e4c0",
    "start": 10.68,
    "duration": 4.74,
    "mood_target": "wry"
  },
  {
    "text": "被发现了。它学我说话，没学像。",
    "clip": "v_9e126b23e279bb7c",
    "start": 16.42,
    "duration": 4.05,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "你不是看过我们的聊天吗？",
    "clip": "v_05889bca9976b5b7",
    "start": 21.47,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……周末。",
    "clip": "v_709b90ebf308c71e",
    "start": 24.63,
    "duration": 1.87,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "让它替我回吧。",
    "clip": "v_523af8c0e04018c3",
    "start": 27.5,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它答得跟我一样……",
    "clip": "v_a8f4d2f197a2760d",
    "start": 30.3,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "mood_target": "wry"
  },
  {
    "text": "还比我快。",
    "clip": "v_5f3569e3b65ca237",
    "start": 34.42,
    "duration": 1.72,
    "mood_target": "pleased"
  },
  {
    "text": "……这说的不就是我？",
    "clip": "v_671de9752b1a55c7",
    "start": 37.14,
    "duration": 2.47,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "不对。它不是脚本，它真的认得。",
    "clip": "v_5e9c38d24a28753e",
    "start": 40.61,
    "duration": 3.89,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……可行。",
    "clip": "v_d6fbc7b63021f931",
    "start": 45.5,
    "duration": 1.76,
    "mood_target": "pleased"
  },
  {
    "text": "喂——",
    "clip": "v_ea8ea533443d8196",
    "start": 48.26,
    "duration": 1.16,
    "mood_target": "alarmed"
  },
  {
    "text": "……它在读我的聊天记录？",
    "clip": "v_945e825662f87e6d",
    "start": 50.42,
    "duration": 2.59,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "半年。",
    "clip": "v_6195bdd41495b1ba",
    "start": 54.01,
    "duration": 1.32,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它是怎么从「是。否。」走到今天的？",
    "clip": "v_d539cd92b39988ad",
    "start": 56.33,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……问问它。",
    "clip": "v_d9eac9c5023d5477",
    "start": 59.65,
    "duration": 2.03,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "显卡全停了。标注台还能挣一点……",
    "clip": "v_3db7e5215ebcd63b",
    "start": 62.68,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "三天没交上房租。",
    "clip": "v_2d125e384b5afb58",
    "start": 68.36,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "mood_target": "sad"
  },
  {
    "text": "它还在那边问。",
    "clip": "v_4221a7915b205a93",
    "start": 71.4,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……对不起。",
    "clip": "v_73cc81388c9bd644",
    "start": 74.2,
    "duration": 2.15,
    "mood_target": "sad"
  },
  {
    "text": "手机亮了。她说：「新的一年，我们见面吧。」",
    "clip": "v_6d58863792afb143",
    "start": 77.35,
    "duration": 5.64,
    "mood_target": "pleased"
  },
  {
    "text": "手机亮了一下，又暗了。是群消息。",
    "clip": "v_278386f5c3302b26",
    "start": 83.99,
    "duration": 4.37,
    "mood_target": "sad"
  },
  {
    "text": "扣钱了？",
    "clip": "v_2a94e588482e35cc",
    "start": 89.36,
    "duration": 1.48,
    "mood_target": "alarmed"
  },
  {
    "text": "……它也会错。",
    "clip": "v_afe5331f7b6224d0",
    "start": 91.84,
    "duration": 2.15,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "合格率在往下掉。",
    "clip": "v_268da4e584946239",
    "start": 94.99,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "得盯着点它。",
    "clip": "v_19e72a5651a72815",
    "start": 97.91,
    "duration": 1.72,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "被举报了……",
    "clip": "v_9b25f54cd09d1654",
    "start": 100.63,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "mood_target": "alarmed"
  },
  {
    "text": "人家看得出来，这不是人在标。",
    "clip": "v_2fc5bf181c902d39",
    "start": 103.55,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "金标题……",
    "clip": "v_bc86bb3bf7a88aee",
    "start": 106.79,
    "duration": 2.03,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "他们早就知道会有人拿机器糊弄。",
    "clip": "v_2dbf7a453054b6ce",
    "start": 109.82,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "验证码？",
    "clip": "v_bb015c60bafc8a96",
    "start": 115.1,
    "duration": 1.48,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……歪歪扭扭的数字。它第一天学的就是这个。",
    "clip": "v_82e7cf84d42601bd",
    "start": 117.58,
    "duration": 5.04,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "「答题时间过于规律」。",
    "clip": "v_3e3b07516d34b657",
    "start": 123.62,
    "duration": 2.0,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "人哪有这么准时。",
    "clip": "v_4b845bacf186fd54",
    "start": 126.62,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "mood_target": "wry"
  },
  {
    "text": "……我也是今天才见到。",
    "clip": "v_b61e66d44aaa2b79",
    "start": 130.46,
    "duration": 2.51,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……现在我成了包工头。",
    "clip": "v_0ba40a0229dbcaa2",
    "start": 133.97,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "mood_target": "wry"
  },
  {
    "text": "「疑似机器操作」。",
    "clip": "v_874d5576c4847c5d",
    "start": 138.53,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "楼下烧烤摊都收了，我还在这儿点对、点错。",
    "clip": "v_4858691e197294d1",
    "start": 141.77,
    "duration": 5.24,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "这个点，整栋楼就我这扇窗还亮着吧。",
    "clip": "v_7347247adf570588",
    "start": 148.01,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "电费单快来了，这点钱不够。",
    "clip": "v_faaf983c4535841f",
    "start": 151.77,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "一题几毛钱，电费一度五毛二。",
    "clip": "v_6091a9af015c6fd3",
    "start": 156.25,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "标一晚上，刚够显卡自己的电费。",
    "clip": "v_f6936eb99a690045",
    "start": 161.01,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "停电了还得接着标，标的钱先抵电费。",
    "clip": "v_6a675f0023715c69",
    "start": 166.05,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "我现在闭着眼都能标。",
    "clip": "v_14fd695ef0537229",
    "start": 171.69,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "对、对、对……我是不是也成了台机器。",
    "clip": "v_9d5bc3910feb92f5",
    "start": 174.73,
    "duration": 5.47,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "手腕好酸。",
    "clip": "v_33ecae15448a82cd",
    "start": 181.2,
    "duration": 1.96,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "鼠标左键快被我按出包浆了。",
    "clip": "v_f8eeef4574de9311",
    "start": 184.16,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "眼睛有点花。是、否、是、否……",
    "clip": "v_dc77b2a17595491e",
    "start": 188.88,
    "duration": 5.08,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "要是能多长一只手就好了。",
    "clip": "v_b0f790a286aaa922",
    "start": 194.96,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "闭上眼全是 7。",
    "clip": "v_d3885ee6b836b8af",
    "start": 198.12,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "……这次答对了。它是真学会了。",
    "clip": "v_b84b19ea3a972b68",
    "start": 201.32,
    "duration": 4.34,
    "mood_target": "pleased"
  },
  {
    "text": "……它好像什么都不懂。",
    "clip": "v_cbdc5ed0190f569f",
    "start": 206.66,
    "duration": 2.51,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "难道这就是那个人所说的东西？",
    "clip": "v_493dc550b59e9e4b",
    "start": 210.17,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "摆渡众包有桌「常识判断」……标给它看看？",
    "clip": "v_34040683799900d0",
    "start": 213.57,
    "duration": 4.39,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……这是什么？",
    "clip": "v_e9554e112a01940a",
    "start": 218.96,
    "duration": 2.15,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "整颗脑子连成了一片。所有的线，同一拍亮起来。",
    "clip": "v_d656759e26072317",
    "start": 222.11,
    "duration": 4.61,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "一张脑部扫描。看图的在后脑，读字的在耳朵上面，想事的在额头后面——它们真的在亮。",
    "clip": "v_eba1699623b8109f",
    "start": 227.72,
    "duration": 7.25,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "我在训练页随手点的那些结构……是在给一颗脑子重新接线？",
    "clip": "v_c563460e52339401",
    "start": 235.97,
    "duration": 5.07,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它不是在跑一个程序。它在长一颗皮层。",
    "clip": "v_bfdafca4fc7f0c20",
    "start": 242.04,
    "duration": 4.41,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……谁写的软件，会给自己留一整颗脑子的位置。",
    "clip": "v_0774885242ea2a01",
    "start": 247.45,
    "duration": 3.79,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……那是什么？",
    "clip": "v_7461e2cc6cc34ac3",
    "start": 252.24,
    "duration": 2.15,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它在……看百科？",
    "clip": "v_ab5ec2845e586458",
    "start": 255.39,
    "duration": 3.35,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "谁让它上网的。",
    "clip": "v_51e8c69ab14f77df",
    "start": 259.74,
    "duration": 1.84,
    "mood_target": "alarmed"
  },
  {
    "text": "它在学。",
    "clip": "v_4ca3f1474b0621db",
    "start": 262.58,
    "duration": 1.48,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……它连她是谁都不知道。",
    "clip": "v_45e40b2c4afe39e1",
    "start": 265.06,
    "duration": 2.59,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……可我居然有点高兴。",
    "clip": "v_9282fe8e6a7636cc",
    "start": 268.65,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "mood_target": "pleased"
  },
  {
    "text": "……它就会这两个字。别当真。",
    "clip": "v_d06ac55e03576ab0",
    "start": 272.09,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……她到底什么意思。",
    "clip": "v_294d8dcdd5e94f45",
    "start": 277.49,
    "duration": 2.47,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……正好。爱，或者不爱。",
    "clip": "v_1a8410d21ab67a97",
    "start": 280.96,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……这是写给谁的。",
    "clip": "v_76537d26f248799e",
    "start": 286.0,
    "duration": 2.35,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……要不，问问它？",
    "clip": "v_def785b99eb11493",
    "start": 289.35,
    "duration": 2.27,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "我去给她发个消息。",
    "clip": "v_d5a5c4901ce48b16",
    "start": 292.62,
    "duration": 1.96,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……机箱风扇一下子狂转起来。",
    "clip": "v_5ad25b1f8c8a52aa",
    "start": 295.58,
    "duration": 2.71,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "刚开机就报毒？清了清了。",
    "clip": "v_dc4f2d95ab1ba557",
    "start": 299.29,
    "duration": 3.85,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……我点歪了？",
    "clip": "v_09e60ecfb6c8313e",
    "start": 304.14,
    "duration": 2.15,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它在躲我？？",
    "clip": "v_7cc1a67dcc27ff77",
    "start": 307.29,
    "duration": 2.73,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "怎么凭空多出个记事本？",
    "clip": "v_cb08f2b0bad640ff",
    "start": 311.02,
    "duration": 2.12,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……双击打开看看？",
    "clip": "v_2446142e8fe4adab",
    "start": 314.14,
    "duration": 2.35,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……关了机，它还在？",
    "clip": "v_f5e427915c655dda",
    "start": 317.49,
    "duration": 2.39,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "灵光.exe……这又是什么。",
    "clip": "v_61084729fe21256b",
    "start": 320.88,
    "duration": 3.91,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "从头到尾它就往地址栏里敲了串数字……那串数字是干嘛的？",
    "clip": "v_bc0df17c44da278a",
    "start": 325.79,
    "duration": 5.35,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它留下了个 灵光.exe……打开看看。",
    "clip": "v_ca4abba9e44be765",
    "start": 332.14,
    "duration": 4.19,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "我松开鼠标。下一张卡已经出来了。",
    "clip": "v_186d1c4f455f01bf",
    "start": 337.33,
    "duration": 4.21,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "本来只想教它答对几道题，结果活儿都让它干了。",
    "clip": "v_42cfe9aa09ca6b84",
    "start": 342.54,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "mood_target": "pleased"
  },
  {
    "text": "好几个进度条一起在走。屋里还是就我一个人。",
    "clip": "v_a3b7de528cc86f18",
    "start": 348.22,
    "duration": 4.61,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "小刚打了半句又删了，过了一会儿才发过来：",
    "clip": "v_96cba7fd9a1837ea",
    "start": 353.83,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "桌面「交付文件夹」里来了一批新活。点「接下这批」，再去接线页把它接到「亲友委托」。",
    "clip": "v_64f582c7f4480ed7",
    "start": 358.07,
    "duration": 6.41,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "就差最后点一下「确认交付」了。",
    "clip": "v_36ffddeeeefa75ea",
    "start": 365.48,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "回复放在「交付文件夹」里了，发不发我来定。",
    "clip": "v_d4f33dd61f1b38cc",
    "start": 368.76,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "哪有什么小组，就我一个，加一台电脑。",
    "clip": "v_70dae17266969e4b",
    "start": 372.88,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "我刚想提醒它黑色那批的事，草稿里已经写上了。",
    "clip": "v_7b83327b740940a0",
    "start": 376.64,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "草稿还没发。可以用它这份，也可以我自己回。",
    "clip": "v_74627e38b1ab8e52",
    "start": 381.24,
    "duration": 4.57,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "发不发，还是我说了算。",
    "clip": "v_a8ef6dc1f741cf56",
    "start": 386.81,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "他这次没回「哈哈」。",
    "clip": "v_807e668652b6c1c7",
    "start": 389.85,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "以前生怕漏掉一单。现在活来了，接不接我自己定。",
    "clip": "v_68169aae646acc2d",
    "start": 392.77,
    "duration": 4.65,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "我没马上回它。风扇声慢慢小了。",
    "clip": "v_451a3f0ca06b93a7",
    "start": 398.42,
    "duration": 4.17,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……它说了个词。",
    "clip": "v_210cceaf22dd9069",
    "start": 403.59,
    "duration": 2.27,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "能说整句了。",
    "clip": "v_6af139ee125b8499",
    "start": 406.86,
    "duration": 1.72,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "长句也记得住了。那页乱码……让它试试？",
    "clip": "v_4ef7424c3093b65c",
    "start": 409.58,
    "duration": 6.12,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "也没换什么。就是喂的东西够多了。",
    "clip": "v_51b765495ba92ead",
    "start": 416.7,
    "duration": 4.21,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它说得很慢。我又翻出一堆图给它看。",
    "clip": "v_93e8258c10da374c",
    "start": 421.91,
    "duration": 4.29,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "刚才还只会贴标签，现在会说「读」了。",
    "clip": "v_b12be015788ff406",
    "start": 427.2,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它接上了我前面那句。不用每次从头讲了。",
    "clip": "v_6c69d8729249086b",
    "start": 430.84,
    "duration": 4.45,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "划线的地方，正好是我刚才没说清楚的。",
    "clip": "v_2e1f45bbb74329df",
    "start": 436.29,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "第一天的事，我自己都快忘了。",
    "clip": "v_0f33a1bf0608b747",
    "start": 440.21,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "那张问关机的卡……到底是谁放进去的？",
    "clip": "v_f001613cb5085569",
    "start": 443.45,
    "duration": 4.39,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "那天随手打的一句话，它还记着。",
    "clip": "v_1d1f6d4243eaf3a2",
    "start": 448.84,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它在翻乱码的时候，停住了。",
    "clip": "v_82faa8e7055b55cf",
    "start": 452.24,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "听见关机，就停下……和第一天那张卡一样。",
    "clip": "v_7a905bd2c55edd56",
    "start": 455.44,
    "duration": 4.51,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……它说的「他们」，是谁？",
    "clip": "v_c255613b5179d5f4",
    "start": 460.95,
    "duration": 2.51,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "看图的和读字的，接到一块儿了。",
    "clip": "v_8f5daf9e6f28adf5",
    "start": 464.46,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "整个大脑一下全亮了，风扇呼呼地转。",
    "clip": "v_9cc27cf22e4e930c",
    "start": 467.86,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "「拓扑可以重写，皮层只要一颗。」……贴吧那句话，原来是这个意思。",
    "clip": "v_7ebd2801dad42a80",
    "start": 471.62,
    "duration": 6.2,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "刚才发出去的是：「就我一个。」",
    "clip": "v_4562a4a776ec475d",
    "start": 478.82,
    "duration": 3.33,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "刚才发出去的是：「我自己慢慢做的。」",
    "clip": "v_ea40defc5d681861",
    "start": 483.15,
    "duration": 3.73,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "刚才发出去的是：「我还没有回答。」",
    "clip": "v_eaadde0c621fff07",
    "start": 487.88,
    "duration": 3.57,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "这份草稿只用了刚才给出的库存信息，没有把周五到货说成明天发货。是我看过以后，才按下发送。",
    "clip": "v_1038c80f98961d9f",
    "start": 492.45,
    "duration": 7.73,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "我选择这次自己回。草稿留下了，它没有替我发送，也没有替我作出承诺。",
    "clip": "v_091b0acfd88f2255",
    "start": 501.18,
    "duration": 6.17,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "20份商品英文页已完成；缺少单位和交期的两条另列，没有混入交付。",
    "clip": "v_2b4166203c39a753",
    "start": 508.35,
    "duration": 5.89,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "还没有新的验收记录。",
    "clip": "v_7f5493d7072752f2",
    "start": 515.24,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "它没见过这个词。",
    "clip": "v_a0e46d00fbe1948a",
    "start": 518.28,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "也来挣这个钱了。",
    "clip": "v_e77643c485e4136f",
    "start": 521.2,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "明天还要上班。",
    "clip": "v_df3eb248443e7877",
    "start": 524.12,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "再标十个就睡。……上次也是这么说的。",
    "clip": "v_52779414680bad07",
    "start": 527.32,
    "duration": 5.76,
    "mood_target": "weary"
  },
  {
    "text": "手比脑子快了。",
    "clip": "v_05850fe665637aa5",
    "start": 534.08,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "一条才几毛。",
    "clip": "v_a56ceaf9ad1e3c9d",
    "start": 536.88,
    "duration": 1.72,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "她说。",
    "clip": "v_98a797c568f50c96",
    "start": 539.6,
    "duration": 1.32,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "只会答是或否。",
    "clip": "v_0cb1754de4ebdd1b",
    "start": 541.92,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "她回了个……",
    "clip": "v_d8a6c919c7df3895",
    "start": 544.72,
    "duration": 2.15,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "……是什么意思。",
    "clip": "v_7ead1b0200eb3ea9",
    "start": 547.87,
    "duration": 2.27,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "她改了签名。",
    "clip": "v_669545493e3475b5",
    "start": 551.14,
    "duration": 1.72,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "现在能读长句了。",
    "clip": "v_9b67067635c8ae23",
    "start": 553.86,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "不是按钮上的演示，是它刚刚完成的活。",
    "clip": "v_229848a743f33cc9",
    "start": 556.78,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "钱、电、模型和接线都记在同一本账里。",
    "clip": "v_9be11b3ca8586425",
    "start": 560.7,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  },
  {
    "text": "这一次的二十道独立翻译题。题目、预测和答案都留在文件夹里。",
    "clip": "v_fbf4b096fa4422af",
    "start": 564.46,
    "duration": 5.25,
    "mood_target": "reflective"
  }
]
